WEBVTT

3f1c9a2e-7b4d-4e11-9a0c-5d2e8f1b6a01/1-0
00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:09.870
<v Anjali Mehta (Product)>Okay, the employment gap check. Any gap longer than 6 months between two jobs needs an explanation from the candidate.</v>

3f1c9a2e-7b4d-4e11-9a0c-5d2e8f1b6a01/2-0
00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:13.400
<v Anjali Mehta (Product)>They pick a reason from a list and can add a short note.</v>

3f1c9a2e-7b4d-4e11-9a0c-5d2e8f1b6a01/3-0
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.650
<v Karthik Rao (Engineering)>What's in the list? Study, health, family, travel, job search?</v>

3f1c9a2e-7b4d-4e11-9a0c-5d2e8f1b6a01/4-0
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.300
<v Anjali Mehta (Product)>Yes, those five, plus "Other". If they choose Other, the note is mandatory.</v>

3f1c9a2e-7b4d-4e11-9a0c-5d2e8f1b6a01/5-0
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:08.900
<v Karthik Rao (Engineering)>And the officer? Do they approve each explanation?</v>

3f1c9a2e-7b4d-4e11-9a0c-5d2e8f1b6a01/6-0
00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:15.750
<v Sunita Iyer (Verification Ops)>Only gaps over 12 months. Those the officer must mark Accepted or Needs proof. Shorter gaps are accepted automatically.</v>

3f1c9a2e-7b4d-4e11-9a0c-5d2e8f1b6a01/7-0
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.400
<v Sunita Iyer (Verification Ops)>If it's Needs proof, the candidate has 5 working days to upload a document.</v>

3f1c9a2e-7b4d-4e11-9a0c-5d2e8f1b6a01/8-0
00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:50.100
<v Karthik Rao (Engineering)>What happens if they don't upload in 5 days?</v>

3f1c9a2e-7b4d-4e11-9a0c-5d2e8f1b6a01/9-0
00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:55.000
<v Anjali Mehta (Product)>Good question. Let's decide that with the client next week.</v>
